message: "If you use PhysBound in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PhysBound"
abstract: >-
  Physical Layer Linter — an MCP server that validates RF and physics
  calculations (link budgets, Shannon capacity, thermal noise, antenna
  gain, radar range and ambiguity) against hard physical limits,
  catching AI hallucinations in engineering workflows.
